{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"armour_iron_mail","model_identifier":"armour_iron_mail","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## armour_iron_mail\n\nArmour set, iron mail.\n\n- Cubes: 10 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -12.0..12.0, y 18.0..51.0, z -6.0..6.0 (size 24.0 x 33.0 x 12.0 u = 68 x 93 x 34 cm).\nIron mail hauberk to mid-thigh (fine checker pixel pattern) on `torso` with a split skirt on `hips`, sleeves on `arm_upper_r/l` and down over the upper forearm on `arm_lower_r/l` (all inflate 1.0). Iron grade textures (bloom / wrought / refined). Same bones/pivots as warrior_base. A team-colour belt sash (`team_sash`, RGB 52, 96, 178) is worn over the armour so the unit keeps its team colour.\n- Embedded texture: iron_refined. Tier textures: iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `armour_iron_mail_iron_bloom.png`, `armour_iron_mail_iron_wrought.png`, `armour_iron_mail_iron_refined.png`\n"},"description":"## armour_iron_mail\n\nArmour set, iron mail.\n\n- Cubes: 10 (0 rotated). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -12.0..12.0, y 18.0..51.0, z -6.0..6.0 (size 24.0 x 33.0 x 12.0 u = 68 x 93 x 34 cm).\nIron mail hauberk to mid-thigh (fine checker pixel pattern) on `torso` with a split skirt on `hips`, sleeves on `arm_upper_r/l` and down over the upper forearm on `arm_lower_r/l` (all inflate 1.0). Iron grade textures (bloom / wrought / refined). Same bones/pivots as warrior_base. A team-colour belt sash (`team_sash`, RGB 52, 96, 178) is worn over the armour so the unit keeps its team colour.\n- Embedded texture: iron_refined. Tier textures: iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `armour_iron_mail_iron_bloom.png`, `armour_iron_mail_iron_wrought.png`, `armour_iron_mail_iron_refined.png`\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"hauberk","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-7.0,33.0,-4.0],"to":[7.0,50.0,4.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":1.0,"origin":[0.0,33.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,14.0,17.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[28,0,36.0,17.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[14,0,28.0,17.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[36,0,44.0,17.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,42,14.0,50.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[14,42,28.0,50.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"0e9568e7-00f2-57df-b3f2-44528adc298b"},{"name":"hem_front","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-6.0,19.0,-3.5],"to":[6.0,33.0,-2.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":1.0,"origin":[0.0,28.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[44,0,56.0,14.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[36,17,37.0,31.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,17,12.0,31.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[37,17,38.0,31.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[20,54,32.0,55.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[32,54,44.0,55.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"40852dd6-be9c-5cdc-8497-70327c1441d3"},{"name":"hem_back","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-6.0,19.0,2.5],"to":[6.0,33.0,3.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":1.0,"origin":[0.0,28.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[12,17,24.0,31.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[38,17,39.0,31.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[24,17,36.0,31.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[39,17,40.0,31.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[44,54,56.0,55.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,56,12.0,57.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"ccc26fc3-eaf6-58c9-b06d-1eece5b3bcbe"},{"name":"hem_side_r","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[5.0,20.0,-2.5],"to":[6.0,33.0,2.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":1.0,